➕ Program 3 — Append Data to a File

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to add new content at the end of an existing text file without removing its previous contents.

It uses "ofstream" with "std::ios::app" to open the file in append mode.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 📂 Opening an existing file
- ➕ Appending data
- 🧵 File output streams
- ⚠️ File-opening error handling
- 🔒 Closing the file

📁 File Used

"message.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Feature

"std::ios::app"
